  "title": "Bertha&#39;s Pecan Cream Pie",
  "description": "A custard made with ground pecans and cooked in a double boiler. The filling is poured into a baked pie shell, covered with meringue, and baked to a delicate golden brown,",
  "authors": [
    "DebnBruce Shook"
  ],
